<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>PeptideChecker — the verified list</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0b0e13; --surface:#12161e; --surface-2:#161b24;
    --line:rgba(255,255,255,.10); --line-strong:rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    --ink:#eef1f6; --ink-2:#aab3c0; --ink-3:#7d8794;
    --amber:#d99b4a; --amber-ink:#1a1206;
    --pass:#4ea882; --warn:#d3a03f; --fail:#c9645e;
    --serif:"Playfair Display",Georgia,serif;
    --sans:"Inter",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    --mono:"JetBrains Mono",ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  a{color:inherit}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}

  /* disclosure bar */
  .disclosure{background:var(--surface-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);letter-spacing:.02em}
  .disclosure .wrap{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px}
  .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--warn);flex:none}

  /* header */
  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(11,14,19,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  header .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px}
  .brand{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .brand span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--ink-3);margin-left:10px;vertical-align:2px}
  nav{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2)}
  nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
  .btn{background:var(--amber);color:var(--amber-ink);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:3px;text-decoration:none}
  .btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}

  /* hero + list */
  .hero{padding:56px 0 8px}
  .hero h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,58px);line-height:1.06;margin:0 0 18px;letter-spacing:-.015em;max-width:16ch}
  .hero p{color:var(--ink-2);max-width:62ch;margin:0 0 28px}

  .tablewrap{border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface)}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
  th{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--ink-3);text-align:left;padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface-2);font-weight:400}
  td{padding:18px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:middle}
  tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
  .src{font-weight:600}
  .src a{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-3);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;font-weight:400;margin-top:2px}
  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
  .chip{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid}
  .chip.pass{color:var(--pass);border-color:rgba(78,168,130,.35);background:rgba(78,168,130,.08)}
  .chip.warn{color:var(--warn);border-color:rgba(211,160,63,.35);background:rgba(211,160,63,.08)}
  .chip.fail{color:var(--fail);border-color:rgba(201,100,94,.35);background:rgba(201,100,94,.08)}
  .score{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:30px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .score.good{color:var(--pass)} .score.bad{color:var(--fail)}
  .delisted .src{text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--ink-3)}
  .tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--fail);display:block;margin-top:4px}
  .note{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-3);margin:14px 0 0;max-width:70ch}

  /* sections */
  section{padding:72px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--amber);margin:0 0 14px}
  h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,40px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:-.01em;max-width:22ch}
  .lede{color:var(--ink-2);max-width:64ch;margin:0 0 36px}

  .gates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
  .gate{background:var(--surface);padding:24px}
  .gate .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--amber)}
  .gate h3{font-size:16px;margin:8px 0 6px}
  .gate p{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;margin:0}

  .weights{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
  .w{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 3fr auto;gap:24px;align-items:center;padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}
  .w:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .bar{height:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}
  .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--amber)}
  .w b{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:500}

  .three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;margin-top:44px}
  .three h4{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}
  .three p{color:var(--ink-2);font-size:14px;margin:0}

  blockquote{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;border-left:2px solid var(--amber);padding-left:22px;margin:36px 0 10px;max-width:56ch}
  cite{font-style:normal;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-3);padding-left:24px}

  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:40px 0;color:var(--ink-3);font-size:13px}

  @media(max-width:820px){
    .gates,.three{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    nav a:not(.btn){display:none}
    .w{grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:12px}
    .w .bar{display:none}
    td,th{padding:14px 12px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="disclosure"><div class="wrap"><span class="dot"></span>Demo data — no vendor has been audited yet. Every score below is a sample.</div></div>

<header><div class="wrap">
  <div class="brand">PeptideChecker <span>VERIFICATION LAYER</span></div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#gates">Methodology</a>
    <a href="#list">The list</a>
    <a href="#earn">How we earn</a>
    <a class="btn" href="#list">See the list</a>
  </nav>
</div></header>

<div class="wrap hero" id="list">
  <h1>A list that can afford to say no.</h1>
  <p>Four public checks, applied to the certificates vendors already publish. Below 7.0 is not listed — including vendors that pay us.</p>

  <div class="tablewrap">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Source</th><th>Gate results</th><th style="text-align:right">Score</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td class="src">Vendor A<a href="#">View report</a></td>
          <td><div class="chips"><span class="chip pass">Loads</span><span class="chip pass">Lab named</span><span class="chip pass">Lot named</span><span class="chip pass">Matches page</span></div></td>
          <td class="score good">9.1</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="src">Vendor B<a href="#">View report</a></td>
          <td><div class="chips"><span class="chip pass">Loads</span><span class="chip pass">Lab named</span><span class="chip pass">Lot named</span><span class="chip warn">Date gap</span></div></td>
          <td class="score">8.4</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="src">Vendor C<a href="#">View report</a></td>
          <td><div class="chips"><span class="chip pass">Loads</span><span class="chip pass">Lab named</span><span class="chip pass">Lot named</span><span class="chip warn">1 of 4 lots</span></div></td>
          <td class="score">7.2</td></tr>
        <tr class="delisted"><td class="src">Vendor D<span class="tag">DELISTED</span></td>
          <td><div class="chips"><span class="chip pass">Loads</span><span class="chip fail">No lab named</span><span class="chip fail">No lot</span><span class="chip fail">Mismatch</span></div></td>
          <td class="score bad">4.6</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="note">No exceptions. No sponsored tier. A vendor whose evidence fails is removed even when removing them costs us money.</p>
</div>

<section id="gates"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">01 — THE FOUR GATES</p>
  <h2>The test, in full. Run it yourself.</h2>
  <p class="lede">Nothing here is proprietary. Open any vendor's COA and apply these four checks in the order given.</p>
  <div class="gates">
    <div class="gate"><div class="n">01</div><h3>It exists and it loads</h3><p>A link that 404s, or a COA available only on request, is a fail.</p></div>
    <div class="gate"><div class="n">02</div><h3>It names the lab</h3><p>An unattributed result is an assertion with a chart on it.</p></div>
    <div class="gate"><div class="n">03</div><h3>It names a specific lot</h3><p>One generic PDF reused across a catalogue proves nothing about your vial.</p></div>
    <div class="gate"><div class="n">04</div><h3>It matches the page</h3><p>Compound, strength and date must agree with what is being sold.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">02 — SCORING</p>
  <h2>One published rubric, applied to documents that are already public.</h2>
  <p class="lede">Safety before price before shipping, on every page. Below 7 out of 10 is not listed.</p>
  <div class="weights">
    <div class="w"><span>Purity</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:40%"></i></span><b>40%</b></div>
    <div class="w"><span>COA transparency</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:20%"></i></span><b>20%</b></div>
    <div class="w"><span>Consistency across lots</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:20%"></i></span><b>20%</b></div>
    <div class="w"><span>Price</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:10%"></i></span><b>10%</b></div>
    <div class="w"><span>Shipping</span><span class="bar"><i style="width:10%"></i></span><b>10%</b></div>
  </div>
  <div class="three">
    <div><h4>Not a vendor</h4><p>No inventory, no shipping. It never touches product.</p></div>
    <div><h4>Not a laboratory</h4><p>It runs no tests and commissions none. It verifies evidence that already exists.</p></div>
    <div><h4>Not a review site</h4><p>Opinions are abundant and free. The scarce thing is a document that survives four checks.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">03 — THE PROBLEM</p>
  <h2>The evidence exists. None of it can be checked.</h2>
  <p class="lede">The COA stopped being a verification artifact and became a marketing asset. Nothing stops a vendor publishing one, no standard says what it must contain, and no third party checks whether the document describes what is in the bottle. A signal that costs nothing to produce carries no information.</p>
  <blockquote>“One vial arrived with a COA whose lot number matched nothing on the paperwork. Now I spend forty minutes cross-checking every purchase and I'm still not sure.”</blockquote>
  <cite>Dan, 34 — third order, two vendors.</cite>
</div></section>

<section id="earn"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">04 — HOW WE EARN</p>
  <h2>Affiliate commission, disclosed.</h2>
  <p class="lede">Buyers pay nothing, ever. Revenue is affiliate commission on referrals to verified vendors only. Commission rate is never an input to a score, and a vendor whose evidence fails is delisted even though that removal costs us money.</p>
</div></section>

<footer><div class="wrap">For research purposes only. Not medical advice. PeptideChecker operates no laboratory and commissions no testing.</div></footer>

</body>
</html>
